REDRAW
UNDORESUME
CTURNOUT DESIGNER SHOW Regular Turnout
PARAMETER turnout-designer anglemode 1
PARAMETER turnout-designer td_reg_len1 6.000
PARAMETER turnout-designer td_reg_len2 6.000
PARAMETER turnout-designer td_reg_off2 0.500
